cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fesom_port: a C port of the FESOM2 ocean and sea-ice model"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it, together with the FESOM2 model it ports."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Koldunov
    given-names: Nikolay
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3365-8146"
    affiliation: Alfred Wegener Institute, Helmholtz Centre for Polar and Marine Research
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/koldunovn/fesom_port"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A line-by-line translation into C of the ocean and sea-ice core of the FESOM2
  unstructured-mesh model: z* vertical coordinate, cvmix_TKE, KPP and
  Pacanowski-Philander mixing, Gent-McWilliams/Redi, flux-corrected tracer
  transport, EVP and mEVP sea-ice dynamics, sea-ice thermodynamics, and JRA55-do
  bulk forcing. It serves as the reference implementation for the C++/Kokkos port
  (fesom_kokkos), which reproduces it byte for byte on the Serial back-end.
keywords:
  - ocean model
  - sea ice
  - FESOM2
  - unstructured mesh
  - C
references:
  - type: article
    title: "The Finite-volumE Sea ice-Ocean Model (FESOM2)"
    authors:
      - family-names: Danilov
        given-names: Sergey
      - family-names: Sidorenko
        given-names: Dmitry
      - family-names: Wang
        given-names: Qiang
      - family-names: Jung
        given-names: Thomas
    journal: Geoscientific Model Development
    volume: 10
    start: 765
    end: 789
    year: 2017
    doi: 10.5194/gmd-10-765-2017
